{% from "_macros.j2" import gallery %}
---
title: {{ source.title }}
---

<div class="nysh-hero nysh-hero--source" markdown>
<div class="nysh-hero__text" markdown>

# {{ source.title }}

<div class="nysh-hero__facts">
<span class="nysh-hero__fact">{{ source.type }}</span>
{% if source.authority %}
<span class="nysh-hero__fact">{{ source.authority }}</span>
{% endif %}
{% if source.repository_ref %}
<span class="nysh-hero__fact"><code>{{ source.repository_ref }}</code></span>
{% endif %}
{% if source.fetched %}
<span class="nysh-hero__fact">отримано {{ source.fetched }}</span>
{% endif %}
</div>
</div>
{% if source.url %}
<div class="nysh-hero__actions" markdown>
[Відкрити джерело]({{ source.url }}){ .md-button .md-button--primary }
</div>
{% endif %}
</div>

{% if source.coverage %}
## Покриття

| Регіон | Парафія | Роки | Записи | Статус |
|---|---|---|---|---|
{% for c in source.coverage %}
| {{ region_names.get(c.region, c.region) }} | {{ c.parish or "—" }} | {{ c.year_from }}{% if c.year_to %}–{{ c.year_to }}{% endif %} | {% for rt in c.record_types %}{{ cov_rt_labels.get(rt, rt) }}{% if not loop.last %}, {% endif %}{% else %}—{% endfor %} | {{ cov_status_labels.get(c.status, c.status) }} |
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if referenced_facts %}
## Що на ньому тримається

<div class="nysh-plist" markdown>
{% for entry in referenced_facts %}
[<span class="nysh-pc__name">{{ entry.person_name }}</span><span class="nysh-pc__years">{{ entry.fact_type | fact_label }}</span>](../persons/{{ entry.person_id }}.md){ .nysh-pc }
{% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if documents %}
## Доказ-вирізки

{{ gallery(documents) }}
{% endif %}

{% if source.notes %}
## Нотатки

{{ source.notes }}
{% endif %}

<p class="nysh-meta">ID <code>{{ source.id }}</code></p>
